---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "メンバー紹介"
description: "教員・学生一覧"
---
<div class="page-heading container">
  <h1>メンバー紹介</h1>
  <p>{{ site.labName }}に所属する教員・学生を紹介します（学年は年度時点のものです）。</p>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="member-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">教員</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for person in members.faculty %}
        <div class="card member-card">
          <img class="member-card__photo" src="{{ person.photo }}" alt="">
          <span class="member-card__role">{{ person.role }}</span>
          <p class="member-card__name">{{ person.name }}</p>
          <p class="member-card__theme">{{ person.field }}</p>
          <p class="member-card__theme">{{ person.bio }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="member-group">
      <h2 class="section__heading">学生</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for person in members.students %}
        <div class="card member-card">
          <img class="member-card__photo" src="{{ person.photo }}" alt="">
          <span class="member-card__role">{{ person.grade }}</span>
          <p class="member-card__name">{{ person.name }}</p>
          <p class="member-card__theme">研究テーマ：{{ person.theme }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
